      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Try a double jump:

    1. Press <color=#FFD54A>C</color> and cut yourself
    into a top and a bottom piece.

    2. Control the bottom piece and jump with
    the top piece riding on it.

    3. In mid-air, press <color=#FFD54A>F</color>
    to switch to the top piece, then press <color=#FFD54A>Space</color> to jump again.'
